he infinite-loop guard for `(a*)*`. RM6/RM7.\n- `OP_BRA` fast path at 5623: `if (mb->hasthen || Frdepth == 0)` forces the frame-creating `GROUPLOOP`; otherwise non-final branches use RM1 and the final branch continues in-frame. **Row: same pattern with and without a `(*THEN)` anywhere ⇒ different frame counts ⇒ different `match_limit` consumption.**\n- `RETURN_SWITCH` (6909–6943): `if (Feptr > mb->last_used_ptr) mb->last_used_ptr = Feptr;` then `if (Frdepth == 0) return rrc;`. Valid `Freturn_id` set = RM1–RM39, RM100–RM103 (wide chars), RM200–RM224 (Unicode); anything else ⇒ `PCRE2_ERROR_INTERNAL`.","usage":{"total_tokens":148751,"tool_uses":42,"duration_ms":553936},"uuid":"43bd6832-5bd9-4645-b246-1ec0cfcc9c9a","session_id":"cde48455-d5ce-4cd5-a0b0-2154082e5ad7"}
