{"type":"system","subtype":"task_notification","task_id":"afc4e81230e5243e7","tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01X7TwwhWorp7Ydr7bYEPTaV","status":"completed","output_file":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-tBNRGp/tmp/claude-31072124/-local-home-scheschb--harvest-work-harvest-work-tBNRGp-translated-rust/cde48455-d5ce-4cd5-a0b0-2154082e5ad7/tasks/afc4e81230e5243e7.output","summary":"I have everything. Here is the configuration surface analysis.\n\n---\n\n# Build assumptions\n8-bit (`PCRE2_CODE_UNIT_WIDTH==8`), `SUPPORT_UNICODE` defined ⇒ `SUPPORT_WIDE_CHARS` defined, `MAYBE_UTF_MULTI` defined, no JIT, `LINK_SIZE=2` ⇒ `MAX_PATTERN_SIZE = 1<<16` (`pcre2_intmodedep.h:143`), `MAX_MARK = 255` (`:233`), `COMPILE_WORK_SIZE = 3000*2 = 6000` code units (`pcre2_compile.c:136`).\n\nKey limits: `MAX_GROUP_NUMBER 65535` (:117), `MAX_REPEAT_COUNT 65535` / `REPEAT_UNLIMITED 65536` (:118-119), `GROUPINFO_DEFAULT_SIZE 256` (:145), `WORK_SIZE_SAFETY_MARGIN 100` (:150), `NAMED_GROUP_LIST_SIZE 20` (:157), `PARSED_PATTERN_DEFAULT_SIZE 1024` (:163), `ECLASS_NEST_LIMIT 15` (`pcre2_internal.h:563`), `MAX_NAME_COUNT 10000` / `MAX_NAME_SIZE 128` / `MAX_VARLOOKBEHIND 255` / `PARENS_NEST_LIMIT 250` (`config.h:216,223,229,268`), `LOOKBEHIND_MAX 65535`, `MAX_CACHE_BACKREF 128` (`pcre2_study.c:52`).\n\nOption-mask gates (`pcre2_compile.c:685-713`):\n- `PUBLIC_LITERAL_COMPILE_OPTIONS` = ANCHORED|AUTO_CALLOUT|CASELESS|ENDANCHORED|FIRSTLINE|LITERAL|MATCH_INVALID_UTF|NO_START_OPTIMIZE|NO_UTF_CHECK|USE_OFFSET_LIMIT|UTF\n- `PUBLIC_COMPILE_OPTIONS` adds ALLOW_EMPTY_CLASS|ALT_BSUX|ALT_CIRCUMFLEX|ALT_VERBNAMES|DOLLAR_ENDONLY|DOTALL|DUPNAMES|EXTENDED|EXTENDED_MORE|MATCH_UNSET_BACKREF|MULTILINE|NEVER_BACKSLASH_C|NEVER_UCP|NEVER_UTF|NO_AUTO_CAPTURE|NO_AUTO_POSSESS|NO_DOTSTAR_ANCHOR|UCP|UNGREEDY|ALT_EXTENDED_CLASS\n- `PUBLIC_LITERAL_COMPILE_EXTRA_OPTIONS` = EXTRA_MATCH_LINE|EXTRA_MATCH_WORD|EXTRA_CASELESS_RESTRICT|EXTRA_TURKISH_CASING\n- `PUBLIC_COMPILE_EXTRA_OPTIONS` adds ALLOW_SURROGATE_ESCAPES|BAD_ESCAPE_IS_LITERAL|ESCAPED_CR_IS_LF|ALT_BSUX|ALLOW_LOOKAROUND_BSK|ASCII_BSD|ASCII_BSS|ASCII_BSW|ASCII_POSIX|ASCII_DIGIT|PYTHON_OCTAL|NO_BS0|NEVER_CALLOUT\n\nValidation order at entry: `10373` MATCH_INVALID_UTF⇒UTF; `10377` bad-bit check (ERR17); `10384` LITERAL subset check (ERR92); `10395` PCRE2_ZERO_TERMINATED⇒`strlen`; `10399` `patlen > ccontext->max_pattern_length`⇒ERR88; `10410-10415` option→optim_flags overrides.\n\n---\n\n# 1. Compile option bits — every test site\n\n### PCRE2_ANCHORED\n- Never read during parse/codegen. `11108`: `if ((re->overall_options & PCRE2_ANCHORED) == 0) { if (is_anchored(codestart,0,&cb,0,FALSE,dotstar_anchor)) re->overall_options |= PCRE2_ANCHORED; }` — i.e. it *suppresses* the auto-anchor scan.\n- `11186`: `else if ((re->overall_options & PCRE2_ANCHORED) == 0)` — gate for `is_startline`⇒`PCRE2_STARTLINE` (so ANCHORED ⇒ FIRSTCODETYPE can never be 2).\n- `11218`: `if ((re->overall_options & PCRE2_ANCHORED) == 0 || (reqcuflags & REQ_VARY) != 0)` — with ANCHORED, `last_codeunit`/`PCRE2_LASTSET` is set **only** if reqcu follows a variable-length item.\n- Tests: `/abc/` +ANCHORED (LASTSET off), `/a.*c/` +ANCHORED (REQ_VARY ⇒ LASTSET on), `/^abc/` w/o ANCHORED (auto-set), `/(?s).*abc/` w/o (dotstar auto-anchor).\n\n### PCRE2_NO_UTF_CHECK\n- Only `10627`: `if ((options & PCRE2_NO_UTF_CHECK) == 0 && (errorcode = PRIV(valid_utf)(pattern, patlen, erroroffset)) != 0)`. Inside `if (utf)` only. Skips the UTF validity scan of the *pattern*.\n- Tests: valid UTF-8 pattern +UTF with/without NO_UTF_CHECK (both succeed, different code path).\n\n### PCRE2_ENDANCHORED\n- Not read anywhere in these files; validated by mask only, stored in `re->compile_options`/`overall_options` (`10904-10905`). Consumed in `pcre2_match.c:1000`.\n\n### PCRE2_ALLOW_EMPTY_CLASS\n- `4215`: `if (c == CHAR_RIGHT_SQUARE_BRACKET && (cb->external_options & PCRE2_ALLOW_EMPTY_CLASS) != 0 && new_class_mode_state < CLASS_MODE_PERL_EXT)` ⇒ emit `META_CLASS_EMPTY` or `META_CLASS_EMPTY_NOT`. Note it reads **`cb->external_options`**, not the tracked `options`, so `(?i)` etc. can't change it.\n- Codegen `6295-6309`: `META_CLASS_EMPTY`⇒`OP_CLASS` + 32 zero bytes; `META_CLASS_EMPTY_NOT`⇒`OP_ALLANY`.\n- Without the option, `[]a]` parses `]` as a literal at `4260-4267` (`class_range_state=RANGE_OK_LITERAL`).\n- Tests: `[]` , `[^]`, `[]a]`, `[]]*`, nested `[[]]` under ALT_EXTENDED_CLASS. `(?[[]])` must still be rejected.\n\n### PCRE2_ALT_BSUX\n- `1496`: `BOOL alt_bsux = ((options & PCRE2_ALT_BSUX) | (xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ALT_BSUX)) != 0;`\n- Affects only three escapes inside `check_escape`: `\\u` (`1650: if (!alt_bsux) *errorcodeptr = ERR37;` else exactly-4-hex form at `1690-1703`), `\\U` (`1715: if (!alt_bsux) ERR37;` else literal `U`), `\\x` (`2029: if (alt_bsux) { exactly 2 hex digits }` — no `\\x{...}`).\n- Tests: `\\u0041`, `\\uZZZZ` (literal `u`), `\\U`, `\\x41`, `\\x{41}` (with ALT_BSUX this is `x` + `{41}` quantifier-ish literal), each with/without.\n\n### PCRE2_AUTO_CALLOUT\n- `3008`: `if ((options & PCRE2_AUTO_CALLOUT) != 0) parsed_size_needed += (ptrend-ptr)*4;` in `max_parsed_pattern`.\n- `10741`: `parsed_size_needed += 4` for trailing callout.\n- `3143`: `BOOL auto_callout = (options & PCRE2_AUTO_CALLOUT) != 0;` — used at `3196` (LITERAL fast path), `3311`, `3502`, `5888` via `manage_callouts()` (`2731-2884`).\n- `5313`: `if (previous_callout != NULL && (options & PCRE2_AUTO_CALLOUT) != 0 && previous_callout == parsed_pattern - 4 && parsed_pattern[-1] == 255) parsed_pattern = previous_callout;` — an explicit `(?C…)` abolishes the preceding auto callout.\n- Auto callouts get number 255 (`2871-2873`).\n- Tests: `abc` + AUTO_CALLOUT; `a(?C1)b` + AUTO_CALLOUT; `a` + LITERAL + AUTO_CALLOUT; `(?(?=a)b|c)` + AUTO_CALLOUT (condition/callout interaction with `expect_cond_assert`, `3532: ok = expect_cond_assert == 2` for `(?C`).\n\n### PCRE2_CASELESS\n- Parse phase: `4547` (in class) and `8304` (outside): `if ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS) != 0 && ptype == PT_PC && (pdata == ucp_Lu || pdata == ucp_Ll || pdata == ucp_Lt)) { ptype = PT_LAMP; pdata = 0; }` — `\\p{Lu}`⇒`\\p{L&}`.\n- `6139` / `6578`: `req_caseopt = ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS) != 0)? REQ_CASELESS : 0;` (init and on `META_OPTIONS`).\n- `6375-6403` negated one-char class: `if ((utf||ucp) && (options & PCRE2_CASELESS)!=0)` ⇒ maybe `OP_NOTPROP/PT_CLIST/caseset`; else `*code++ = ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS)!=0)? OP_NOTI : OP_NOT;`\n- `6416-6455` two-char positive class case-partner optimization: if `c != d && pptr[2]==d` then `6446: if ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS)==0) { reset_caseful = TRUE; options |= PCRE2_CASELESS; req_caseopt = REQ_CASELESS; }` and jump to `CLASS_CASELESS_CHAR`; undone at `8523-8528`.\n- `7186`: `*code++ = ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS)!=0)? OP_DNREFI : OP_DNREF;` and `7189-7193` emits the REFI flags byte.\n- `8155-8161`: `OP_REFI : OP_REF` + flags byte.\n- `8419-8445`: literal char, `(utf||ucp) && CASELESS` ⇒ `OP_PROP/PT_CLIST/caseset`.\n- `8468`: `*code++ = ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS)!=0)? OP_CHARI : OP_CHAR;`\n- Class building (`pcre2_compile_class.c`): `519` `if ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS) && (options & (PCRE2_UTF|PCRE2_UCP))) class_options |= PARSE_CLASS_CASELESS_UTF;`; `926` `if ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS) != 0)` in `add_to_class` (non-UTF path uses `cb->fcc`, UTF/UCP path uses `UCD_OTHERCASE`); `1196` `if ((options & PCRE2_CASELESS)!=0 && posix_class <= 2) posix_class = 0;` ([:lower:]/[:upper:]⇒[:alpha:]); `1387/1399/1411/1423` `options & ~PCRE2_CASELESS` for `\\h \\H \\v \\V`; `1591` `add_to_class(((options & (PCRE2_UTF|PCRE2_UCP))!=0)? (options & ~PCRE2_CASELESS) : options, …)`.\n- Tests: `a`, `[aA]`, `[^a]`, `[a-z]`, `[[:upper:]]`, `\\1`, `(?<n>a)(?<n>b)\\k<n>` +DUPNAMES, `\\p{Lu}`, each ±CASELESS, and ±UCP/±UTF cross-product.\n\n### PCRE2_DOLLAR_ENDONLY\n- Not tested in these files. Mask-validated, stored (`re->compile_options`), used in `pcre2_match.c:6586`, `pcre2_dfa_match.c:1028,1055`.\n\n### PCRE2_DOTALL\n- `6281`: `*code++ = ((options & PCRE2_DOTALL)!=0)? OP_ALLANY : OP_ANY;` (only site).\n- Indirect: `OP_ALLANY` is what `is_anchored` (`8957: scode[1] != OP_ALLANY`) requires for `.*` auto-anchor; `OP_ANY` is what `is_startline` (`9088: scode[1] != OP_ANY`) requires for `.*`⇒STARTLINE.\n- In `PARSE_TRACKED_OPTIONS` (`3056`), settable by `(?s)`.\n- Tests: `.` ±DOTALL; `.*abc` ±DOTALL (anchored vs startline); `(?s).*a` ; `(?-s).*a`.\n\n### PCRE2_DUPNAMES\n- `5736`: `if ((options & PCRE2_DUPNAMES) == 0) { errorcode = ERR43; }` when a duplicate name with a different number is seen; otherwise `5742-5744` sets `ng->hash_dup |= NAMED_GROUP_IS_DUPNAME; is_dupname = TRUE; cb->dupnames = TRUE;`.\n- `5105`: `(?J)` ⇒ `*optset |= PCRE2_DUPNAMES; cb->external_flags |= PCRE2_JCHANGED;` (only `(?J)` sets JCHANGED, not the API flag).\n- Consequences: duplicated names ⇒ `OP_DNREF/OP_DNREFI` (`7186`), `OP_DNCREF/OP_DNRREF` (`6782`), and the name table gets multiple slots (`pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:131-138,163-186`).\n- Tests: `(?<a>x)(?<a>y)` +DUPNAMES; `(?<a>x)(?<a>x)` (same number ⇒ ignored, `5735`); `(?J)(?<a>x)(?<a>y)`; `(?<a>x)(?<a>y)\\k<a>`; `(?<a>x)(?<a>y)(?(<a>)z)`.\n\n### PCRE2_EXTENDED\n- `3222`: `if ((options & PCRE2_EXTENDED_MORE) != 0) options |= PCRE2_EXTENDED;`\n- `3334-3335`: verb-name handling — `((options & (PCRE2_EXTENDED|PCRE2_ALT_VERBNAMES)) != (PCRE2_EXTENDED|PCRE2_ALT_VERBNAMES))` — only when *both* are set is whitespace/`#` skipped inside `(*MARK:…)`.\n- `3453-3475`: `if ((options & PCRE2_EXTENDED) != 0)` — skip `cb->ctypes[c] & ctype_space`, plus (Unicode) `CHAR_NEL`, `(c|1)==0x200f`, `(c|1)==0x2029`; `#` comment to `IS_NEWLINE(ptr)` (uses `cb->nllen`).\n- Tracked (`3057`), `(?x)` at `5119`.\n- Tests: `a b # c\\nd` +EXTENDED; `a\\x{200e}b`; `(?x) a b`; `(?x:a b)c d`; `(*MARK:a b)` ±EXTENDED ±ALT_VERBNAMES; `#`-comment ending at each newline convention.\n\n### PCRE2_EXTENDED_MORE\n- `3222` implies EXTENDED. `4004`: inside class, `if ((c == CHAR_SPACE || c == CHAR_HT) && ((options & PCRE2_EXTENDED_MORE)!=0 || class_mode_state >= CLASS_MODE_PERL_EXT))` skip. `4202`: same test in the leading-`^`/`\\Q\\E` skip loop at class start.\n- `5122`: `(?xx)`; `5137-5139`: `if ((set & (PCRE2_EXTENDED|PCRE2_EXTENDED_MORE)) == PCRE2_EXTENDED || (unset & PCRE2_EXTENDED)!=0) unset |= PCRE2_EXTENDED_MORE;`\n- Tests: `[a b]` ±EXTENDED_MORE; `[ ^a]`; `(?xx)[a b]`; `(?xx:a)(?x:[a b])` (verify xx cleared by `x`).\n\n### PCRE2_FIRSTLINE\n- Not tested in these files (match-time only: `pcre2_match.c:7398`).\n\n### PCRE2_MATCH_UNSET_BACKREF\n- Only in lookbehind length computation: `9765` `case META_BACKREF_BYNAME: if ((cb->external_options & PCRE2_MATCH_UNSET_BACKREF)!=0) goto ISNOTFIXED;` and `9806` `case META_BACKREF: if ((cb->external_options & PCRE2_MATCH_UNSET_BACKREF)!=0 || (cb->external_flags & PCRE2_DUPCAPUSED)!=0) goto ISNOTFIXED;`\n- Effect: a backreference inside a lookbehind becomes variable-length ⇒ `OP_VREVERSE` instead of `OP_REVERSE`, or ERR25/ERR100.\n- Tests: `(a)(?<=\\1)` ±MATCH_UNSET_BACKREF; `(a)(?<=\\1b)` +option (needs `max_varlookbehind`); `(?|(a))(?<=\\1)` (DUPCAPUSED path).\n\n### PCRE2_MULTILINE\n- `6258-6264`: `if ((options & PCRE2_MULTILINE)!=0) { if (firstcuflags == REQ_UNSET) zerofirstcuflags = firstcuflags = REQ_NONE; *code++ = OP_CIRCM; } else *code++ = OP_CIRC;`\n- `6268`: `*code++ = ((options & PCRE2_MULTILINE)!=0)? OP_DOLLM : OP_DOLL;`\n- Tracked (`3057`), `(?m)` at `5110`, cleared by `(?^)` at `5040`.\n- Indirect: `is_startline` accepts `OP_CIRC` *or* `OP_CIRCM` (`9097`) but `is_anchored` accepts only `OP_CIRC` (`8964`) ⇒ `^a` non-MULTILINE ⇒ ANCHORED; MULTILINE ⇒ STARTLINE (FIRSTCODETYPE 2… but note `^a` sets firstcu 'a'? No: `6260` forces `firstcuflags=REQ_NONE` under MULTILINE ⇒ FIRSTCODETYPE 2).\n- Tests: `^a`, `a$`, `^a$` ±MULTILINE; `(?m)^a`; `(?m:^)a`.\n\n### PCRE2_NEVER_UCP\n- Only `10643`: `if (ucp && (cb.external_options & PCRE2_NEVER_UCP) != 0) { errorcode = ERR75; }`. Valid config: NEVER_UCP set + no UCP + no `(*UCP)`.\n\n### PCRE2_NEVER_UTF\n- Only `10622`: inside `if (utf)`, `if ((options & PCRE2_NEVER_UTF)!=0) errorcode = ERR74;`. Note it reads the *original* `options`, so `PCRE2_NEVER_UTF` + `(*UTF)` in pattern still errors. Valid: NEVER_UTF + non-UTF pattern.\n\n### PCRE2_NO_AUTO_CAPTURE\n- `4733-4743`: `if ((options & PCRE2_NO_AUTO_CAPTURE)==0) { …cb->bracount++; *parsed_pattern++ = META_CAPTURE|cb->bracount; } else *parsed_pattern++ = META_NOCAPTURE;` — only affects plain `(`; `(?<name>…)` still captures (`5701-5702`, unconditional).\n- Tracked (`3057`); `(?n)` at `5111`; cleared by `(?^)` at `5040`.\n- Tests: `(a)(b)` +NO_AUTO_CAPTURE (top_bracket 0); `(a)(?<n>b)` +option; `(?n)(a)(?<n>b)`; `(a)\\1` +option ⇒ must fail (ERR15) — so for valid tests use `(?n)(?<n>a)\\k<n>`.\n\n### PCRE2_NO_AUTO_POSSESS\n- `10410`: `if ((options & PCRE2_NO_AUTO_POSSESS)!=0) optim_flags &= ~PCRE2_OPTIM_AUTO_POSSESS;`\n- `10570`: `(*NO_AUTO_POSSESS)` sets `cb.external_options |= PCRE2_NO_AUTO_POSSESS` back-compat.\n- `11084`: `if (errorcode == 0 && (optim_flags & PCRE2_OPTIM_AUTO_POSSESS)!=0) PRIV(auto_possessify)(temp,&cb);`\n- Tests: `a+b`, `\\d+\\s`, `[a-z]+X`, `a*+b` — with and without.\n\n### PCRE2_NO_DOTSTAR_ANCHOR\n- `10412`: clears `PCRE2_OPTIM_DOTSTAR_ANCHOR`. `10574` for the verb. Consumed at `11110` and `11188` (`dotstar_anchor` argument to `is_anchored`/`is_startline`; tested at `8958` / `9089`).\n- Tests: `(?s).*abc`, `.*abc` — ±option.\n\n### PCRE2_NO_START_OPTIMIZE\n- `10414`: clears `PCRE2_OPTIM_START_OPTIMIZE`. `10578` for the verb. `11122`: `if ((optim_flags & PCRE2_OPTIM_START_OPTIMIZE)!=0) { …firstcu/reqcu/find_firstassertedcu/PRIV(study)… }` — with the option, `PCRE2_FIRSTSET`, `PCRE2_LASTSET`, `PCRE2_STARTLINE`, `PCRE2_FIRSTMAPSET`, `re->minlength` all stay 0/unset (but `PCRE2_ANCHORED` auto-set at `11108` still happens).\n- Tests: `abc` ±NO_START_OPTIMIZE (FIRSTCODETYPE 1 vs 0, MINLENGTH 3 vs 0).\n\n### PCRE2_UCP\n- `2931` (`handle_escdsw`): `if ((options & PCRE2_UCP)==0 || (xoptions & ascii_option)!=0) *parsed_pattern++ = META_ESCAPE+escape; else { META_ESCAPE+prop; (PT_PC<<16)|ucp_Nd | PT_SPACE<<16 | PT_WORD<<16 }`.\n- `3919`: `[[:<:]]`/`[[:>:]]` — `if ((options & PCRE2_UCP)==0) *parsed_pattern++ = META_ESCAPE+ESC_w; else { META_ESCAPE+ESC_p; PT_WORD<<16 }`.\n- `4099-4102`: POSIX class substitution: `if ((options & PCRE2_UCP)!=0 && (xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_POSIX)==0 && !((xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_DIGIT)!=0 && (posix_class==PC_DIGIT || posix_class==PC_XDIGIT)))` ⇒ use `posix_substitutes[]` (`667-681`): alpha→PT_GC/ucp_L, lower→PT_PC/Ll, upper→PT_PC/Lu, alnum→PT_ALNUM, ascii→(-1,0) falls through, blank→(-1,1)⇒`\\h`/`\\H`, cntrl→PT_PC/Cc, digit→PT_PC/Nd, graph→PT_PXGRAPH, print→PT_PXPRINT, punct→PT_PXPUNCT, space→PT_PXSPACE, word→PT_WORD, xdigit→PT_PXXDIGIT.\n- `6111`: `BOOL ucp = (options & PCRE2_UCP)!=0;` used at `6375` and `8419` (caseset handling) and `6433`.\n- `8372`: `if ((options & PCRE2_UCP)!=0 && (xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_BSW)==0) meta_arg = (meta_arg==ESC_B)? OP_NOT_UCP_WORD_BOUNDARY : OP_UCP_WORD_BOUNDARY;`\n- `10642-10643`: ucp set / NEVER_UCP check. `10607` (non-Unicode build only).\n- Class: `pcre2_compile_class.c:519,933,1208,1591`.\n- Study: `pcre2_study.c:1920` `ucp` ⇒ `set_table_bit`/`UCD_CASESET` behaviour, `1999-2003`.\n- Tests: `\\d \\D \\s \\S \\w \\W \\b \\B`, `[[:alpha:]] [[:digit:]] [[:xdigit:]] [[:graph:]] [[:print:]] [[:punct:]] [[:blank:]] [[:ascii:]] [[:cntrl:]] [[:space:]] [[:word:]] [[:lower:]] [[:upper:]] [[:alnum:]]`, `[[:^ascii:]]`, `\\w` in class, `[[:<:]]a`, `a` +CASELESS, all ±UCP and ± each EXTRA_ASCII_*.\n\n### PCRE2_UNGREEDY\n- `6118-6119`: `greedy_default = ((options & PCRE2_UNGREEDY)!=0); greedy_non_default = greedy_default ^ 1;`\n- `6576-6577`: re-set on `META_OPTIONS`.\n- Used at `7332-7347` to pick `repeat_type` (0=greedy path vs 1=minimal): plain quantifiers get `greedy_default`, `?`-suffixed get `greedy_non_default`, `+`-suffixed force `repeat_type = 0` + `possessive_quantifier = TRUE`.\n- Tracked (`3058`), `(?U)` at `5114`.\n- Tests: `a*`, `a*?`, `a*+`, `a{2,4}`, `a{2,4}?`, `a{2,4}+`, `(ab)*`, `[ab]*` each ±UNGREEDY; `(?U)a*`; `(?U)(?-U)a*`.\n\n### PCRE2_UTF\n- `1494` (`check_escape`): `BOOL utf`; gates `\\N{U+…}` (`1561-1569`, only `#ifndef EBCDIC && utf`), `\\u` surrogate/range checks (`1701-1709`), `\\o{}` limits (`1998,2012`), `\\x{}` limits (`2019,2085,2093`), `\\0…` `>0xff`⇒ERR51 only `if (!utf)` (`1956`).\n- `3142`: `utf` in parse (`GETCHARINCTEST`, `read_name`, `get_ucp`, `FORWARDCHARTEST` at `3467`).\n- `6110`: `utf` in codegen — `6375`, `6433`, `7380` (`NOT_FIRSTCU`/`BACKCHAR`), `8366` (`if (!utf) meta_arg = OP_ALLANY;` for `\\C`), `8419`, `8459` (`PRIV(ord2utf)`), `6549`.\n- `9698`: `if ((cb->external_options & PCRE2_UTF)!=0 && escape == ESC_C) { *errcodeptr = ERR36; }` — `\\C` in a lookbehind is an error in UTF mode.\n- `10619`, `10622`, `10627`, `10631` (16-bit only), `10730` (`max_parsed_pattern`), `11020` (`find_recurse(…, utf)`), `11158-11175`, `11201-11209`, `11313`.\n- `pcre2_compile_class.c:516,1085,1118,1154,1627,1644,1845`.\n- Tests: `\\x{100}`, `\\x{10FFFF}`, `\\N{U+41}`, `\\o{400}`, `\\C`, `\\C` in `(?<=\\C)`, 2-byte literal, `[\\x{100}-\\x{200}]`, `a` +CASELESS — each ±UTF.\n\n### PCRE2_NEVER_BACKSLASH_C\n- Only `3664`: inside `case ESC_C:` of parse, `if ((options & PCRE2_NEVER_BACKSLASH_C)!=0) { errorcode = ERR83; goto ESCAPE_FAILED; }` (and `#ifdef NEVER_BACKSLASH_C` ⇒ ERR85 at `3661`).\n- Valid config: NEVER_BACKSLASH_C set, pattern with no `\\C`. Note `PCRE2_EXTRA_BAD_ESCAPE_IS_LITERAL` at `3600` does *not* rescue ERR83 → it does: `ESCAPE_FAILED` jumps to `3598-3610` which converts to literal `C` if BAD_ESCAPE_IS_LITERAL. So `\\C` + NEVER_BACKSLASH_C + BAD_ESCAPE_IS_LITERAL is a **valid** compile producing literal `C`.\n\n### PCRE2_ALT_CIRCUMFLEX\n- Not tested in these files; match-time (`pcre2_match.c:6642`, `pcre2_dfa_match.c:954`).\n\n### PCRE2_ALT_VERBNAMES\n- `3334-3335` (see EXTENDED) and `3384`: `if ((options & PCRE2_ALT_VERBNAMES)!=0) { escape = PRIV(check_escape)(&ptr,ptrend,&c,&errorcode,options,xoptions,cb->bracount,FALSE,cb); } else escape = 0;` Only `0`, `ESC_ub`, `ESC_Q`, `ESC_E` accepted (`3389-3410`), anything else ⇒ ERR40.\n- Tests: `(*MARK:a\\x41b)`, `(*MARK:a\\Qb)c\\Ed)`, `(*MARK:\\n)`, `(*MARK:a\\db)` (must fail with ALT_VERBNAMES, literal without), `(?x)(*MARK:a b)` +ALT_VERBNAMES.\n\n### PCRE2_USE_OFFSET_LIMIT\n- Not tested here; match-time (`pcre2_match.c:7119`).\n\n### PCRE2_LITERAL\n- `10384-10390`: extra-option/option subset check.\n- `10497`: `if ((options & PCRE2_LITERAL) == 0) { … pso_list scan … }` — no `(*…)` verbs processed, `skipatstart` stays 0.\n- `3185-3199`: `if ((options & PCRE2_LITERAL) != 0) { while (ptr<ptrend) { GETCHARINCTEST; if (auto_callout) manage_callouts(); PARSED_LITERAL(c, parsed_pattern); } goto PARSED_END; }` — the whole meta parser is skipped, including EXTENDED, class parsing, `nest_depth`.\n- Note `PCRE2_EXTRA_MATCH_LINE`/`MATCH_WORD` prefix/suffix injection at `3166-3175`/`5894-5903` still applies under LITERAL.\n- Tests: `a.b*c[` +LITERAL; `(*UTF)x` +LITERAL (verbs literal); `a` +LITERAL+CASELESS; `a` +LITERAL+EXTRA_MATCH_WORD; `a` +LITERAL+AUTO_CALLOUT; NUL-containing pattern +LITERAL.\n\n### PCRE2_MATCH_INVALID_UTF\n- `10373`: `if ((options & PCRE2_MATCH_INVALID_UTF)!=0) options |= PCRE2_UTF;` — sole compile-time effect (plus storage). Not stored into `cb.external_options` UTF? It is: `cb.external_options = options` at `10437` *after* the OR.\n\n### PCRE2_ALT_EXTENDED_CLASS\n- `3944`: `class_mode_state = ((options & PCRE2_ALT_EXTENDED_CLASS)!=0)? CLASS_MODE_ALT_EXT : CLASS_MODE_NORMAL;`\n- Enables: nested `[` inside a class (`4127-4129`: `c == CHAR_LEFT_SQUARE_BRACKET && (class_depth_m1 < 0 || class_mode_state == CLASS_MODE_ALT_EXT || …)`), and UTS#18 doubled operators at `4405-4453`: `class_mode_state == CLASS_MODE_ALT_EXT && (c==| or - or & or ~) && ptr<ptrend && *ptr==c` ⇒ `META_ECLASS_OR/SUB/AND/XOR`; triple repetition ⇒ ERR108; mixed precedence ⇒ ERR111 via `cb->class_op_used[class_depth_m1]`; missing `]` diagnostic ERR112 at `4702-4704`.\n- Note it is read from the *tracked* `options` so `(?…)` cannot change it (not in `PARSE_TRACKED_OPTIONS`), but the value is that at the time `[` is seen (from the enclosing group's option state — which equals the external value since no setter touches this bit).\n- Tests: `[a&&b]`, `[[a-z]&&[^aeiou]]`, `[a--b]`, `[\\d||\\s]`, `[a~~b]`, `[[a][b]]`, `[a&&b&&c]`, `[a-z_ -- m]`, and deep nesting to `ECLASS_NEST_LIMIT` (14 levels OK, 15 ⇒ ERR107 at `4155`).\n\n---\n\n# 2. PCRE2_EXTRA_* bits — every test site\n\n| bit | sites | exact construct affected |\n|---|---|---|\n| `ALLOW_SURROGATE_ESCAPES` | `1705` (`\\u`, in `if (utf)`), `2012` (`\\o{}`), `2093` (`\\x{}`); `10632` 16-bit-only rejection | `\\ud800`, `\\o{155000}`, `\\x{d800}` in UTF mode: without the bit ⇒ ERR73; with it ⇒ accepted as code point. Only meaningful under UTF. |\n| `BAD_ESCAPE_IS_LITERAL` | `3600`: `if ((xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_BAD_ESCAPE_IS_LITERAL)==0) goto FAILED; ptr = tempptr; …escape = 0;` — outside class. `4468-4469`: `if ((xoptions & …)==0 || class_mode_state >= CLASS_MODE_PERL_EXT) goto FAILED;` — inside class, never in `(?[…])`. | any `check_escape` error becomes a literal char: `\\q`, `\\y`, `\\F`, `\\l`, `\\L`, `\\u`(no ALT_BSUX), `\\U`, `\\C`+NEVER_BACKSLASH_C, `\\x{`(bad), `\\g`(no number), `\\k`(no name), `\\N{name}`, `\\o` (no `{`), `\\1` with no group 1, `\\x{110000}`. Inside `[…]` too. |\n| `MATCH_WORD` | `3171-3175`: prepend `META_ESCAPE+ESC_b`, `META_NOCAPTURE`; `5899-5903`: append `META_KET`, `META_ESCAPE+ESC_b`; `10735-10737` buffer +4 | wraps whole pattern: `\\b(?:…)\\b`. Mutually exclusive with MATCH_LINE (`else if`). Allowed with LITERAL. |\n| `MATCH_LINE` | `3166-3170`: prepend `META_CIRCUMFLEX`, `META_NOCAPTURE`; `5894-5898`: append `META_KET`, `META_DOLLAR`; `10735` | wraps as `^(?:…)$`. Combined with MULTILINE ⇒ `OP_CIRCM`/`OP_DOLLM`. |\n| `ESCAPED_CR_IS_LF` | `1530`: `if (c == CHAR_CR && (xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ESCAPED_CR_IS_LF)!=0) c = CHAR_LF;` — only in the `i > 0` branch of the escapes table | exactly `\\r` (table value `CHAR_CR`). Does **not** affect `\\x0d`, `\\015`, `\\cM`, `\\o{15}`. Also then `PCRE2_HASCRORLF` is set for the LF (`8474`). |\n| `ALT_BSUX` | `1496` (ORed into `alt_bsux`), `1656`: `if (*ptr == CHAR_LEFT_CURLY_BRACKET && (xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ALT_BSUX)!=0)` ⇒ braced `\\u{…}` form with overflow check ERR77 and `ESC_ub` special return | `\\u{41}`, `\\u{}`⇒`ESC_ub` (parsed as literal `u` `{`, sites `3679-3681` and `3402-3404`), `\\u{ 12}` ⇒ ESC_ub. Also enables `\\x41`/`\\U` like ALT_BSUX. Inside class `\\u{`-bad is just literal `u` (`1687`). |\n| `ALLOW_LOOKAROUND_BSK` | `8338-8343`: `if (cb->assert_depth > 0 && meta_arg == ESC_K && (xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ALLOW_LOOKAROUND_BSK)==0) { *errorcodeptr = ERR99; }` | `\\K` inside any assertion (`(?=\\K)`, `(?<=a\\K)`, `(*pla:\\K)`, `(*sr:…)`? no — only `assert_depth`, incremented at `6642,6855,6860,6879,6886,6891,6896`, i.e. `(?=`,`(?!`,`(?<=`,`(?<!`,`(*napla:`,`(*naplb:`,`(*scs:`). Also `cb->external_flags |= PCRE2_HASBSK` at `8382`. |\n| `CASELESS_RESTRICT` | `pcre2_compile_class.c:522,525(neg),935,1209?(no)`; `pcre2_compile.c:3060` (tracked), `5042` (`(?^)` clears), `5112` (`(?r)`), `6379-6390`, `6423-6427`, `7190`, `8158`, `8423-8431`, `10667-10671` (mutually exclusive with TURKISH_CASING ⇒ ERR106) | caseless matching of non-ASCII case sets: `[k]`+CASELESS+UCP (KELVIN SIGN), `\\x{212a}`, `s`/`\\x{17f}`, `OP_PROP/PT_CLIST` suppression, `REFI_FLAG_CASELESS_RESTRICT` byte on `OP_REFI`/`OP_DNREFI`. Allowed with LITERAL. |\n| `ASCII_BSD` | `2913` (`ascii_option = PCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_BSD` for `\\d`/`\\D`), `2931`; `3061` tracked; `5070` (`(?aD)`), `5099` (`(?a)`) | `\\d`, `\\D` under UCP stay `OP_DIGIT`/`OP_NOT_DIGIT` (bitmap-based) instead of `\\p{Nd}`/`\\P{Nd}`. In and out of classes. |\n| `ASCII_BSS` | `2920`, `2931`; `3061`; `5082` (`(?aS)`), `5099` | `\\s`, `\\S` under UCP stay `OP_WHITESPACE`/`OP_NOT_WHITESPACE` instead of `\\p{Xps}` (`PT_SPACE`). |\n| `ASCII_BSW` | `2927`, `2931`; `3061`; `5094` (`(?aW)`), `5099`; **also** `8372`: `\\b`/`\\B` | `\\w`,`\\W` under UCP stay ASCII; **and** `\\b`,`\\B` stay `OP_WORD_BOUNDARY`/`OP_NOT_WORD_BOUNDARY` instead of the UCP variants. |\n| `ASCII_POSIX` | `4100`: `(xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_POSIX)==0` gate for POSIX-class→`\\p` substitution; `pcre2_compile_class.c:1209` same gate for the GRAPH/PRINT/PUNCT `XCL_PROP` path; `3062` tracked; `5076` (`(?aP)` sets ASCII_POSIX|ASCII_DIGIT), `5101` (`(?a)`) | all `[[:name:]]` classes under UCP revert to ASCII bitmaps. |\n| `ASCII_DIGIT` | `4101-4102`: `!((xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_DIGIT)!=0 && (posix_class == PC_DIGIT || posix_class == PC_XDIGIT))`; `3062`; `5076`, `5088` (`(?aT)`), `5101` | only `[[:digit:]]` and `[[:xdigit:]]` under UCP. |\n| `PYTHON_OCTAL` | `1871-1895`: alternative `\\ddd` disambiguation — 3-digit octal only if `ptr[-1]<=CHAR_7 && ptr[0],ptr[1] in 0-7`, else `read_number`⇒backref (ERR61 if too big). `1953`: `if ((xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_PYTHON_OCTAL)!=0) *errorcodeptr = ERR102;` when `c > 0xff` | `\\12`, `\\123`, `\\1`, `\\8`, `\\9`, `\\0123`, `\\377`, `\\400`. Perl mode (default) uses `1899-1926`: `if (s < 10 || c >= CHAR_8 || (unsigned)s <= bracount)` ⇒ backref. |\n| `NO_BS0` | `1962-1963`: `if ((xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_NO_BS0)!=0 && c == 0 && i == 1) *errorcodeptr = ERR98;` | exactly bare `\\0` (no following octal digit). `\\00`, `\\000`, `\\x00`, `\\o{0}` unaffected. Combine with BAD_ESCAPE_IS_LITERAL for a valid compile of `\\0`⇒literal `0`. |\n| `NEVER_CALLOUT` | `5288-5293`: `case CHAR_C:` `if ((xoptions & PCRE2_EXTRA_NEVER_CALLOUT)!=0) { ptr++; errorcode = ERR103; }` | `(?C…)`. Does **not** block `PCRE2_AUTO_CALLOUT` (auto callouts still emitted). Valid: NEVER_CALLOUT + AUTO_CALLOUT + pattern with no `(?C`. |\n| `TURKISH_CASING` | `10651-10672`: requires `utf || ucp` (ERR104), in 8-bit requires `utf` (ERR105), conflicts with CASELESS_RESTRICT (ERR106); `pcre2_compile_class.c:525,935`; `pcre2_compile.c:6379-6383`, `6425-6427`, `7192`, `8160`, `8423-8427`; also `750-751` `(*TURKISH_CASING)` | caseless `i`/`I`/`ı`/`İ`: `UCD_ANY_I(c)` ⇒ `PRIV(ucd_turkish_dotted_i_caseset) + (UCD_DOTTED_I(c)? 0 : 3)`. Affects literals, negated 1-char classes, class ranges, `OP_REFI`/`OP_DNREFI` flag byte `REFI_FLAG_TURKISH_CASING`. Valid only with UTF in 8-bit. |\n\n---\n\n# 3. In-pattern option setters\n\n## 3a. `(?…)` inline option groups — `pcre2_compile.c:4989-5169`\nEntered via the `default:` case after `(?`. Two forms distinguished at `5152`: ends with `)` ⇒ options change for the rest of the enclosing group (`nest_depth--`, nest block discarded/adjusted); ends with `:` ⇒ `META_NOCAPTURE` emitted, options apply to that group only.\n\nAccepted letters in the `while` loop at `5047-5131`:\n- `-` (`5052`): switches to the unset accumulator; only once, and forbidden after `^` (`hyphenok`, ERR94).\n- `a` (`5065`): two-char forms `aD`→`ASCII_BSD`, `aP`→`ASCII_POSIX|ASCII_DIGIT`, `aS`→`ASCII_BSS`, `aT`→`ASCII_DIGIT`, `aW`→`ASCII_BSW`; bare `a` → all five bits (`5099-5101`).\n- `J` (`5104`) → `PCRE2_DUPNAMES` + `cb->external_flags |= PCRE2_JCHANGED`.\n- `i` → CASELESS; `m` → MULTILINE; `n` → NO_AUTO_CAPTURE; `r` → EXTRA_CASELESS_RESTRICT; `s` → DOTALL; `U` → UNGREEDY (`5109-5114`).\n- `x` → EXTENDED, and a second `x` → also EXTENDED_MORE (`5118-5125`).\n- Anything else ⇒ ERR11.\n\n`(?^…)` (`5038-5045`): `options &= ~(CASELESS|MULTILINE|NO_AUTO_CAPTURE|DOTALL|EXTENDED|EXTENDED_MORE); xoptions &= ~(EXTRA_CASELESS_RESTRICT); hyphenok = FALSE;`\n\nPost-processing `5137-5142`: `if ((set & (EXTENDED|EXTENDED_MORE)) == EXTENDED || (unset & EXTENDED)!=0) unset |= EXTENDED_MORE;` then `options = (options|set) & ~unset; xoptions = (xoptions|xset) & ~xunset;`\n`5163-5168`: if anything changed, emit `META_OPTIONS`, `options`, `xoptions` — consumed at `6573-6579`.\n\nScoping: `nest_save` push at `4997-5006` saving `options & PARSE_TRACKED_OPTIONS` and `xoptions & PARSE_TRACKED_EXTRA_OPTIONS`; restore on `)` at `5839-5840`. `PARSE_TRACKED_OPTIONS` = CASELESS|DOTALL|DUPNAMES|EXTENDED|EXTENDED_MORE|MULTILINE|NO_AUTO_CAPTURE|UNGREEDY (`3056-3058`); `PARSE_TRACKED_EXTRA_OPTIONS` = CASELESS_RESTRICT|ASCII_BSD|ASCII_BSS|ASCII_BSW|ASCII_DIGIT|ASCII_POSIX (`3060-3062`).\n\n`(?|…)` (`5011-5019`): `top_nest->reset_group = top_nest->max_group = cb->bracount; flags |= NSF_RESET; cb->external_flags |= PCRE2_DUPCAPUSED; META_NOCAPTURE`. Branch reset at `5820-5827`; max restore at `5841-5843`.\n\nTests: `(?i)a`, `(?-i)a` after `(?i)`, `(?i:a)b`, `(?^i)`, `(?^)`, `(?i-s:…)`, `(?x-i)`, `(?xx)`, `(?J)`, `(?U)`, `(?n)`, `(?r)`, `(?aD)`,`(?aP)`,`(?aS)`,`(?aT)`,`(?aW)`,`(?a)`, `(?-a)`, `(?)` (empty, no META_OPTIONS emitted), `(?:)`, `(?i)(?:x)`, `(?|(a)|(b))`, `(?|(a)|(b))\\1`.\n\n## 3b. Start-of-pattern verbs — `pso_list` (`740-763`), scanned at `10499-10596`\nLoop requires `patlen - skipatstart >= 2 && ptr[skipatstart]=='(' && ptr[skipatstart+1]=='*'`, repeats while a table entry matches. Skipped entirely under `PCRE2_LITERAL`.\n\n| verb | type | effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| `(*UTF8)` | PSO_OPT | `cb.external_options |= PCRE2_UTF` (8-bit spelling of `STRING_UTFn_RIGHTPAR`, `pcre2_compile.c:79`) |\n| `(*UTF)` | PSO_OPT | `|= PCRE2_UTF` |\n| `(*UCP)` | PSO_OPT | `|= PCRE2_UCP` |\n| `(*NOTEMPTY)` | PSO_FLG | `setflags |= PCRE2_NOTEMPTY_SET` → `re->flags` |\n| `(*NOTEMPTY_ATSTART)` | PSO_FLG | `setflags |= PCRE2_NE_ATST_SET` |\n| `(*NO_AUTO_POSSESS)` | PSO_OPTMZ | `optim_flags &= ~PCRE2_OPTIM_AUTO_POSSESS` **and** `cb.external_options |= PCRE2_NO_AUTO_POSSESS` (`10570`) |\n| `(*NO_DOTSTAR_ANCHOR)` | PSO_OPTMZ | clears `PCRE2_OPTIM_DOTSTAR_ANCHOR`, sets `PCRE2_NO_DOTSTAR_ANCHOR` (`10574`) |\n| `(*NO_JIT)` | PSO_FLG | `setflags |= PCRE2_NOJIT` |\n| `(*NO_START_OPT)` | PSO_OPTMZ | clears `PCRE2_OPTIM_START_OPTIMIZE`, sets `PCRE2_NO_START_OPTIMIZE` (`10578`) |\n| `(*CASELESS_RESTRICT)` | PSO_XOPT | `xoptions |= PCRE2_EXTRA_CASELESS_RESTRICT` |\n| `(*TURKISH_CASING)` | PSO_XOPT | `xoptions |= PCRE2_EXTRA_TURKISH_CASING` |\n| `(*LIMIT_HEAP=n)` | PSO_LIMH | `limit_heap = n` → `re->limit_heap` |\n| `(*LIMIT_MATCH=n)` | PSO_LIMM | `limit_match = n` |\n| `(*LIMIT_DEPTH=n)` | PSO_LIMD | `limit_depth = n` |\n| `(*LIMIT_RECURSION=n)` | PSO_LIMD | synonym of LIMIT_DEPTH |\n| `(*CR)` | PSO_NL | `newline = PCRE2_NEWLINE_CR; setflags |= PCRE2_NL_SET` |\n| `(*LF)` `(*CRLF)` `(*ANY)` `(*NUL)` `(*ANYCRLF)` | PSO_NL | ditto with respective values |\n| `(*BSR_ANYCRLF)` | PSO_BSR | `bsr = PCRE2_BSR_ANYCRLF; setflags |= PCRE2_BSR_SET` |\n| `(*BSR_UNICODE)` | PSO_BSR | `bsr = PCRE2_BSR_UNICODE; setflags |= PCRE2_BSR_SET` |\n\nNumeric parse (`10540-10557`): digits, overflow break at `c > UINT32_MAX/10 - 1`, must be terminated by `)` else ERR60. `(*LIMIT_MATCH=)` ⇒ ERR60 (`pp == skipatstart`).\n\nThere is **no** `(*ALT_EXTENDED_CLASS)` verb — only the `PCRE2_ALT_EXTENDED_CLASS` compile option. Likewise no `(*NO_AUTO_CAPTURE)`.\n\nTests: each verb alone; stacked `(*UTF)(*UCP)(*CR)abc`; `(*LIMIT_MATCH=100)(*LIMIT_DEPTH=50)(*LIMIT_HEAP=1000)x`; `(*NO_JIT)a`; verb order/repetition; `(*UTF)` after another verb; a `(*` that matches nothing (`10595 break`) e.g. `(*ACCEPT)` at pattern start (falls through to normal parsing).\n\n---\n\n# 4. Compile-context settings\n\nDefaults (`pcre2_context.c:129-142`): tables=`PRIV(default_tables)`, max_pattern_length=`PCRE2_UNSET`, max_pattern_compiled_length=`PCRE2_UNSET`, bsr=`BSR_DEFAULT`, newline=`NEWLINE_DEFAULT`, parens_nest_limit=250, extra_options=0, max_varlookbehind=255, optimization_flags=`PCRE2_OPTIMIZATION_ALL`.\n\n- **`pcre2_set_newline`** (`:363-380`, accepts CR/LF/CRLF/ANY/ANYCRLF/NUL only). Consumed `10680-10719`: `cb.nltype = NLTYPE_FIXED` + `cb.nllen`/`cb.nl[]` for CR(1,`\\r`), LF(1,`\\n`), NUL(1,`\\0`), CRLF(2,`\\r\\n`); `NLTYPE_ANY` for ANY; `NLTYPE_ANYCRLF` for ANYCRLF. Stored `re->newline_convention = newline` (`10914`).\n  Compile-time effect: **only** `#`-comment termination in `/x` mode (`3459: if (IS_NEWLINE(ptr)) { ptr += cb->nllen; break; }`). Overridden by `(*CR)` etc. (`newline` starts 0; `10680: if (newline == 0) newline = ccontext->newline_convention`).\n  Tests: `(?x)a#c\\rb`, `…#c\\nb`, `…#c\\r\\nb`, `…#c\\x0bb` (ANY), `…#c\\0b` (NUL) — one per convention, verifying where the comment ends.\n- **`pcre2_set_bsr`** (`:334-347`, UNICODE|ANYCRLF only). Stored at `10913` (`re->bsr_convention`); `10676: if (bsr == 0) bsr = ccontext->bsr_convention;`. No compile-time codegen difference for `\\R` (`OP_R` chosen at `3690`/`8386` regardless). Overridden by `(*BSR_ANYCRLF)`/`(*BSR_UNICODE)`.\n- **`pcre2_set_max_varlookbehind`** (`:382-387`). `10442: cb.max_varlookbehind = ccontext->max_varlookbehind;` Used only at `10066-10071`: `if (variable) { gbptr[1] = minlength; if ((PCRE2_SIZE)maxlength > cb->max_varlookbehind) { *errcodeptr = ERR100; } }` (fixed-length lookbehinds set `gbptr[1] = LOOKBEHIND_MAX` at `10073` and are exempt).\n  Tests: `(?<=a{1,5})` with limit 5 (ok) / 4 (ERR100); `(?<=a|bb)` (variable, max 2); `(?<=ab)` (fixed, exempt from the limit but bounded by `LOOKBEHIND_MAX`/ERR87 at `9959`); limit 0 with a fixed-length lookbehind ⇒ still OK.\n- **`pcre2_set_parens_nest_limit`** (`:389-394`). Single site `3235-3239`: `if (nest_depth > cb->cx->parens_nest_limit) { errorcode = ERR19; }`, checked at the *top* of each parse-loop iteration. `nest_depth` incremented at `4732` (plain `(`), `4848` (`(*sr:`/`(*asr:`), `4996` (`(?|`/options-group), `5430` (`(?(`), `5602` (atomic), `5663` (`POST_ASSERTION`), `5703` (named capture); decremented at `5154` (options ended with `)`) and `5865`.\n  Tests: limit 250 default with 250 vs 251 nested `(`; `pcre2_set_parens_nest_limit(0)` with `a` (OK) and `(a)` (ERR19); limit 1 with `(a)` / `((a))`.\n- **`pcre2_set_max_pattern_length`** (`:349-354`). `10399: if (patlen > ccontext->max_pattern_length) { *errorptr = ERR88; return NULL; }` — checked *after* `PCRE2_ZERO_TERMINATED` resolution, before everything else. Tests: length 3 pattern with limit 3 (OK) and 2 (ERR88); limit 0 with zero-length pattern.\n- **`pcre2_set_max_pattern_compiled_length`** (`:356-361`). `10873: if (re_blocksize > ccontext->max_pattern_compiled_length) { errorcode = ERR101; }` where `re_blocksize = CU2BYTES(names_found*name_entry_size) [+ aligned char_lists_size] + CU2BYTES(length)` — **excludes** `sizeof(pcre2_real_code)` (added at `10880`). Tests: query `PCRE2_INFO_SIZE` first, then set the limit to that value and to value-1.\n- **`pcre2_set_character_tables`** (`:326-331`). `10423-10428`: `tables = (ccontext->tables != NULL)? ccontext->tables : PRIV(default_tables); cb.lcc/fcc/cbits/ctypes = tables + …`. Stored `re->tables = tables` (`10898`).\n  Compile-time uses of `cb->fcc`: `6439` (`TABLE_GET(c, cb->fcc, c)` two-char-class case partner), `11160`/`11230` (`cb.fcc[firstcu] != firstcu` ⇒ `PCRE2_FIRSTCASELESS`/`PCRE2_LASTCASELESS`), `pcre2_compile_class.c:943,963` (`add_to_class`). `cb->ctypes`: `3350` (verb-name space), `3455` (`/x` space), `4758` (`ctype_lcletter` for alpha assertions), `3523`, `2624` (`ctype_word` in `read_name`), `pcre2_compile_class.c:1523-1524` (EBCDIC only). `cb->cbits`: `pcre2_compile_class.c:1079,1269-1283,1340-1373` (POSIX + `\\d\\s\\w` bitmaps).\n  Tests: default tables vs `pcre2_maketables` under a non-C locale (e.g. `tr_TR.UTF-8` or `fr_FR.ISO-8859-1`) for `[[:alpha:]]`, `\\w`, `[a-z]`+CASELESS, `(?i)a`, `[[:lower:]]`, `(*name)` alpha-assertion recognition.\n- **`pcre2_set_optimize`** (`:412-448`): `PCRE2_OPTIMIZATION_NONE`⇒`optimization_flags = 0`; `PCRE2_OPTIMIZATION_FULL`⇒`PCRE2_OPTIMIZATION_ALL`; directives 64..69 ⇒ `if ((directive&1)!=0) flags &= ~(1u << ((directive>>1)-32)); else flags |= 1u << ((directive>>1)-32);` mapping `PCRE2_AUTO_POSSESS`(64)⇒bit0=`PCRE2_OPTIM_AUTO_POSSESS`, `AUTO_POSSESS_OFF`(65)⇒clear bit0, `DOTSTAR_ANCHOR`(66)⇒bit1, `DOTSTAR_ANCHOR_OFF`(67), `START_OPTIMIZE`(68)⇒bit2, `START_OPTIMIZE_OFF`(69). Bits from `pcre2_internal.h:602-604`.\n  Consumed at `10320` (`optim_flags` init), `10410-10415` (option overrides), `10561` (verbs), `10921` (`re->optimization_flags`), `11084`, `11110`, `11122`, `11188`.\n  Tests: 9 configurations × a probe pattern set: NONE, FULL, AUTO_POSSESS_OFF, DOTSTAR_ANCHOR_OFF, START_OPTIMIZE_OFF, and each `_ON` after NONE. Probe patterns: `a+b` (possessify), `(?s).*x` (anchor), `abc` (firstcu/minlength), `[Ww]ord` (bitmap→FIRSTCASELESS in study).\n- **`pcre2_set_compile_recursion_guard`** (`:403-410`). Single site `8598-8604` in `compile_regex`: `if (cb->cx->stack_guard != NULL && cb->cx->stack_guard(cb->parens_depth, cb->cx->stack_guard_data)) { *errorcodeptr = ERR33; cb->erroroffset = 0; }`. Called on entry to every group, both passes. `cb->parens_depth` incremented at `6921`, decremented `6948`, reset to 0 at `10448` and `10933`.\n  Tests: guard always returning 0 with `((((a))))`; guard returning 1 at depth ≥ 3 (ERR33); guard counting invocations to confirm it fires twice per group (pre-pass + real pass).\n\n---\n\n# 5. Pattern shapes / distinct code paths\n\n**Input framing**\n- `pattern == NULL && patlen == 0` ⇒ `10355-10358` `pattern = null_str` (`{0xcd}`) — valid, compiles empty.\n- `patlen == 0` with non-NULL pointer.\n- `patlen == PCRE2_ZERO_TERMINATED` ⇒ `10395-10396`.\n- Embedded NUL: `\"a\\0b\"` with explicit length 3 — no special handling, `\\0` is a literal char (and `PARSED_LITERAL`); test also `(*CR)` after a NUL, and NUL as newline convention.\n\n**Literals / OP_CHAR family** (`8407-8530`)\n- single char `a` ⇒ `OP_CHAR`; `firstcu='a'`, `firstcuflags=req_caseopt`.\n- long run `abcdefghij` ⇒ 10 × `OP_CHAR` (PCRE2 emits one opcode per char); firstcu 'a', reqcu 'j'.\n- `+CASELESS` ⇒ `OP_CHARI`.\n- `[^a]` ⇒ `OP_NOT` / `OP_NOTI` (`6403`).\n- `+CASELESS+UCP` with a multi-case char (`k`, `s`, `\\x{c5}`) ⇒ `OP_PROP PT_CLIST caseset` (`8438`); `[^k]` ⇒ `OP_NOTPROP PT_CLIST` (`6394`).\n- UTF multi-byte literal ⇒ `PRIV(ord2utf)` (`8459`), and repeat path `7380-7386` `BACKCHAR`.\n- `mclength != 1 && req_caseopt != 0` ⇒ `8502: firstcuflags = reqcuflags = REQ_NONE`.\n- 32-bit-only `META_BIGVALUE` path (`8124`) — unreachable in 8-bit.\n\n**Classes** (`pcre2_compile_class.c`)\n- `META_CLASS_EMPTY` ⇒ `OP_CLASS`+zeros; `META_CLASS_EMPTY_NOT` ⇒ `OP_ALLANY` (`6295-6304`).\n- one-char positive class `[a]` ⇒ folded to `NORMAL_CHAR_SET` (`6348-6357`).\n- one-char negative `[^a]` ⇒ `OP_NOT(I)`/`OP_NOTPROP`.\n- two-char case-partner `[Aa]` ⇒ `OP_CHARI` with `reset_caseful` (`6416-6455`); verify `[Ab]` is *not* folded, `[Kk]`+UCP+CASELESS_RESTRICT is folded, `[Ii]`+TURKISH_CASING is not.\n- `OP_CLASS` (`1861`: `negate_class == should_flip_negation`) e.g. `[abc]`, `[a-c]`, `[[:alpha:]]`.\n- `OP_NCLASS` (`negate_class != should_flip_negation`) e.g. `[^abc]`, `[\\D]`, `[\\S]`, `[\\W]` (each sets `should_flip_negation` at `1344/1354/1371`).\n- `OP_ALLANY` from a class (`1845-1858`): requires `SELECT_VALUE8(!utf,0) || negate_class != should_flip_negation` and all 8 classwords `~0` — e.g. `[\\s\\S]` non-UTF, `[\\x00-\\xff]` non-UTF, `[^\\x{0}-\\x{10ffff}]`-style negations.\n- `OP_XCLASS` (`1705-1829`): needs `XCLASS_REQUIRED`. In 8-bit this needs `utf` (`1118: if (utf)`), so: `[\\x{100}]`, `[\\p{L}]`, `[\\P{L}]`, `[a\\x{100}]` (⇒ `XCL_MAP` set), `[\\x{100}-\\x{200}]` (`XCL_RANGE`), `[[:^ascii:]]`+UCP, `[\\x{100}\\x{102}\\x{104}\\x{106}\\x{108}\\x{10a}]` (≥6 high ranges ⇒ `XCLASS_HAS_CHAR_LISTS`, `XCL_LIST` + backwards char-list storage, `1744-1823`), `[\\p{Any}]`/`[^\\p{Any}]` (`1441-1447`, `parse_class:410-419`).\n- `XCLASS_HIGH_ANY` (`1154-1156`): last range ends at `MAX_UTF_CODE_POINT` and starts ≤256 ⇒ `should_flip_negation = TRUE`, `range = end` (`1606-1612`) — e.g. `[\\W]`+UTF, `[^\\x00-\\xff]`+UTF.\n- `OP_ECLASS` (`compile_class_nested`, `2571-2768`): only when `op_info.op_single_type == 0`, i.e. a non-foldable operator tree, e.g. `(?[\\p{L} - [a-z]])`, `[\\p{L}&&\\p{Latin}]`. Otherwise folded back to `OP_ALLANY`/`OP_CLASS`/`OP_NCLASS`/`OP_XCLASS` (`2622-2724`) — worth one test per branch: `[a&&a]`(⇒OP_CLASS), `[\\W||\\w]`(⇒OP_ALLANY), `[^[a]&&[^b]]`, `(?[ [\\p{L}] & [\\x{100}-\\x{200}] ])`(⇒OP_XCLASS with `need_map`).\n- `ECL_NOT` / `fold_negation` (`1880-1923`), `fold_binary` ECL_AND/OR/SUB/XOR (`1930-2117`), `compile_class_juxtaposition` (`2294-2348`) implicit union: `[a-z_ -- m]`.\n- ranges crossing 0x80/0xFF: `[\\x7f-\\x81]`, `[\\xfe-\\x{101}]`+UTF, `[\\x00-\\xff]`, `[a-\\x{ff}]`.\n- caseless class with UCP: `[a-z]`+CASELESS+UCP, `[\\x{212a}]`+CASELESS+UCP (`utf_caseless_extend`, `152-261`), `[k]`+CASELESS+UCP+CASELESS_RESTRICT.\n- `add_to_class` byte-fast-path vs bit-path: `byte_start >= byte_end` (`972`) for short ranges vs `memset`-like loop for long ones — test `[a-c]` and `[\\x00-\\xff]`.\n- POSIX `[.ch.]` / `[=ch=]` are errors (ERR13); top-level `[:alpha:]` outside a class is ERR12/13 (`3925-3931`).\n\n**Quantifiers** (`7279-8121`)\n- Per `op_previous` branch: `OP_CHAR/CHARI/NOT/NOTI` (`7370`, `OUTPUT_SINGLE_REPEAT`), `OP_CLASS/NCLASS/XCLASS/ECLASS/REF/REFI/DNREF/DNREFI` (`7412-7442`, `OP_CRSTAR/CRPLUS/CRQUERY/CRRANGE + repeat_type`), `OP_RECURSE` (`7453-7515`), bracket group family (`7524-7536`), single-char types (`\\d`,`\\w`,`.`,`\\p`) via `op_type`/`prop_type`.\n- Shapes: `a?`,`a*`,`a+`,`a{0}`,`a{1}`,`a{3}`,`a{2,}`,`a{2,4}`,`a{0,3}`,`a{0,}`, each with `+`/`?` suffix; `[ab]{0}` (the `code < last_code` rewind case, `6190`), `(a){0}`, `(?:a){2,3}`, `(?=a)*`, `(?R)+`, `\\1{2,3}`, `\\d{3,}`, `.{2}`, `\\p{L}{2,4}` (`prop_type >= 0` at `7986/8014`), `x{65535}`, `x{65536}` (ERR5).\n- Possessive wrap (`8057-8121`): `opcode_possessify` hit (`a++`⇒`OP_POSPLUS`) vs `OP_ONCE` wrap (`(?:ab)++`, `(a){2,3}+`, `\\1++`, `[a-z]{2,}+`, `\\p{L}++`).\n- `{n,m}` with spaces/tabs: `read_repeat_counts` (`1349-1450`) skips space/HT after `{`, around `,`, before `}` — test `a{ 2 , 4 }`.\n- `\\N{2,3}` quantified-`\\N` path (`1610-1636`).\n- `(*ACCEPT)?` — the `3610`-area wrap: `4927 okquantifier = (verbs[i].meta == META_ACCEPT)`, wrapped in `META_NOCAPTURE`/`META_KET` at `3873-3888`.\n\n**Groups**\n- `(a)` `META_CAPTURE`⇒`OP_CBRA` (`8251-8256`); `(?:a)`⇒`OP_BRA`; `(?>a)`⇒`OP_ONCE` (`5599-5604`, `6899`); `(?|(a)|(b))` (`5011-5019`); `(?<n>a)`, `(?'n'a)`, `(?P<n>a)` (`5686-5690`, `5175-5184`); `(?<n>a)(?<n>b)`+DUPNAMES; name length 1 and 128 (`2669: ptr - *nameptr > MAX_NAME_SIZE` ⇒ ERR48); UTF group names (`2620-2643`, `ucp_L`/`ucp_Nd`/`_`); `>= MAX_NAME_COUNT` names.\n- `named_group_list_size` growth (`5769-5788`): 21+ distinct names forces the heap realloc (`newsize = size*2`, freed at `11289`).\n- `name_entry_size` growth (`5715-5716`).\n- Name-table insertion order (`pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:140-186`): test `(?<b>)(?<a>)` (out-of-order insert, `memmove`), substring-name case (`143: crc == 0 && slot[IMM2_SIZE+length] != 0`) e.g. `(?<ab>)(?<a>)`.\n\n**Backreferences**\n- `\\1`…`\\9` (offset in `cb.small_ref_offset[]`, `3625-3632`), `\\10`+ (inline `PUTOFFSET`), `\\g1`, `\\g{1}`, `\\g{-1}` (relative via `read_number(&p,ptrend,bracount,…)` at `1803`), `\\g{ 1 }`, `\\k<n>`, `\\k'n'`, `\\k{n}`, `\\g{n}`(⇒`ESC_k`), `(?P=n)` (`5199-5204`), `\\g<n>`/`\\g'n'` (⇒`META_RECURSE_BYNAME`, `3757-3778`).\n- `HANDLE_SINGLE_REFERENCE` (`8153`) vs `OP_DNREF` (`7186`).\n\n**Conditions** (`5428-5594`, `6653-6846`)\n- `(?(1)a|b)` `META_COND_NUMBER`⇒`OP_CREF`; `(?(+1)…)`/`(?(-1)…)`; `(?(<n>)…)`, `(?('n')…)`, `(?(n)…)` ⇒ `META_COND_NAME`⇒`OP_CREF` or `OP_DNCREF`; `(?(R)…)`⇒`META_COND_RNUMBER` name \"R\"⇒`OP_RREF RREF_ANY`; `(?(R1)…)`⇒`OP_RREF 1`; `(?(R&n)…)`⇒`META_COND_RNAME`⇒`OP_RREF`/`OP_DNRREF`; `(?(DEFINE)…)`⇒`OP_DEFINE`→`OP_FALSE` (`6986-6996`, one branch only, ERR54 for two); `(?(VERSION>=10.0)a|b)` and `(?(VERSION=10.0)…)` (`5468-5518`, `6829-6840`); `(?(?=a)b|c)` ⇒ `META_COND_ASSERT` (`5440-5446`, `6844`).\n- Branch count check `6976-7013`: `condcount > 2` ⇒ ERR27; `condcount == 1` ⇒ `subfirstcuflags = subreqcuflags = REQ_NONE`.\n- Named group \"R\" ambiguity: `(?<R>a)(?(R)b)` — name found ⇒ treated as name (`6720`).\n\n**Lookarounds**\n- `(?=a)`⇒`OP_ASSERT`; `(?!a)`⇒`OP_ASSERT_NOT`, and `(?!)`⇒`OP_FAIL` optimization (`6869-6875`: `pptr[1]==META_KET && (pptr[2] < META_ASTERISK || pptr[2] > META_MINMAX_QUERY)`); `(?!)*` keeps `OP_ASSERT_NOT`.\n- `(?<=ab)`⇒`OP_ASSERTBACK` + `OP_REVERSE 2` (`8678-8680`, `lookbehindminlength == LOOKBEHIND_MAX`); `(?<=a|bb)` variable ⇒ `OP_VREVERSE min max` (`8684-8687`); `(?<!a)`⇒`OP_ASSERTBACK_NOT`.\n- `(*napla:a)`⇒`OP_ASSERT_NA`; `(*naplb:a)`⇒`OP_ASSERTBACK_NA`.\n- Alpha assertion table (`565-606`), all accepted names: `pla` `plb` `napla` `naplb` `nla` `nlb` `positive_lookahead` `positive_lookbehind` `non_atomic_positive_lookahead` `non_atomic_positive_lookbehind` `negative_lookahead` `negative_lookbehind` `scs` `scan_substring` `atomic` `sr` `asr` `script_run` `atomic_script_run`. All require a following `:` (`4766-4770`, ERR95).\n- `cb->max_lookbehind`: set from `branchlength` at `10047`; also `\\A`/`\\b`/`\\B` force `if (cb->max_lookbehind == 0) cb->max_lookbehind = 1;` (`8378`).\n- `get_branchlength` (`9583-9982`) item lengths: `\\R`⇒min1/max2 (`9690-9694`); `\\X`⇒`-1` (not fixed); classes⇒1; `META_CLASS_EMPTY_NOT`/`META_DOT`⇒1; `\\p`/`\\P` skip prop word (`9705`).\n- Tests: `(?<=\\R)`, `(?<=a{2,4})`, `(?<=(a|bb))`, `(?<=(?<=a)b)` (nested), `(?<=\\d)`, `(?<=(?1))(a)` (subroutine length), `(?<=\\1)(a)`, `(?<=(?R))` (local recursion ⇒ ISNOTFIXED), lookbehind inside lookahead (`9712-9744`), the 2000-iteration `lcptr` guard (`9600`, ERR35).\n\n**Recursion / subroutines**\n- `(?R)`/`(?R0)` (`5210-5219`), `(?0)`, `(?1)`, `(?+1)`, `(?-1)` (`4990-4991` `RECURSION_BYNUMBER`, `5224-5252`), `(?&name)` (`5257-5263`), `(?P>name)` (`5189`), `\\g<1>`, `\\g'1'`, `\\g<name>`.\n- With capture-list arguments: `(?1(2,3))`, `(?&n(<a>,<b>))` via `parse_capture_list`/`compile_parse_recurse_args` (`5272-5277`, `8198-8238`, `pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:506-630` inc