ge, the Rust `.so` panicked (`panic = \"abort\"`); isolate with `--exact <testname>`.\n- Then run `timeout 300 python3 check_coverage.py` and confirm your file contributes rows 294..351.\n\n## Final report must state\n- the exact commands run and the final PASS output,\n- the `check_coverage.py` CONFIGS line showing your rows covered,\n- every `src/*.rs` fix (file, what was wrong, what the C does),\n- every `CONFIGS.md` cell you corrected and why."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_read_input_tokens":424623,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":796,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cde48455-d5ce-4cd5-a0b0-2154082e5ad7","uuid":"48828bd7-9193-426d-b616-3cec0b59e795","timestamp":"2026-08-23T10:57:26.249Z"}
